  "tines runs": "Usage: tines runs [options] [command]

Agent runs: attempts at issues by runners

Options:
  -h, --help             display help for command

Commands:
  list [options]         List runs, newest first
  show [options] <id>    Show a run; --logs prints the captured log tail, --logs
                         --full the whole log
  cancel [options] <id>  Cancel a run (judged like any other end: usually a
                         strike)
  help [command]         display help for command
",
  "tines runs cancel": "Usage: tines runs cancel [options] <id>

Cancel a run (judged like any other end: usually a strike)

