",
  "tines usage": "Usage: tines usage [options]

Compare finalized run spend for a period

Options:
  --window <window>             today, 7d, or 30d (choices: "today", "7d",
                                "30d")
  --from <bound>                custom inclusive start (date or offset
                                timestamp)
  --to <bound>                  custom exclusive end (date or offset timestamp)
  --issue <ref>                 direct issue lifetime through now
  --scope <token>               replay a frozen usage scope
  --evidence <kind>             list evidence (choices: "issues", "runs")
  --member <issue-id>           narrow run evidence to one contributing issue
  --population <population>     finalized or pending (choices: "finalized",
                                "pending")
  --sort <sort>                 evidence sort (choices: "cost", "time")
  --direction <direction>       sort direction (choices: "asc", "desc")
  --cursor <token>              evidence page cursor
  --limit <count>               evidence page size (1-100)
  --all-pages                   fetch every evidence page
  --project <name-or-id>        project scope (including archived), or unknown
  --workflow <name-or-id>       workflow filter, or unknown
  --state <id>                  starting state id (requires --workflow)
  --runner <name-or-id>         runner filter, or unknown
  --tier <tier>                 tier filter
  --outcome <outcome>           recorded outcome (choices: "advanced",
                                "stalled", "interrupted", "unknown")
  --accounting-status <status>  price coverage (choices: "priced", "unpriced",
                                "unreported")
  --by <dimension>              group dimension (choices: "project", "workflow",
                                "state", "outcome", "runner", "tier", default:
                                "workflow")
  -u, --url <url>               base URL of the Tines API (or set TINES_API_URL,
                                or run \`tines login\`; default
                                https://tines.tbuckley.dev)
  --api-key <key>               API key (or set TINES_API_KEY, or run \`tines
                                login\`)
  --json                        output the raw JSON response
  -h, --help                    display help for command
",
  "tines workflows": "Usage: tines workflows [options] [command]

Manage the workflow library

Options:
  -h, --help                                          display help for command

Commands:
  export [options] <workflow-id-or-unambiguous-name>  Export a canonical workflow package JSON document
  validate [options] <file>                           Validate a workflow package file (use - for stdin)
  preview [options] <file>                            Prepare and fully review a destination workflow package plan
  install [options] <file>                            Install one exactly reviewed workflow package plan
  list [options]                                      List the workflow library
  show [options] <id-or-name>                         Show a workflow with states and transitions
  bases [options]                                     List the states other states inherit context from, with their children
  create [options] [json]                             Create a workflow from a JSON definition (states carry initial "prompt" instructions)
  edit [options] <id-or-name> [json]                  Update a workflow from a JSON definition and/or flags
  delete [options] <id-or-name>                       Delete a workflow (refused while issues still reference it)
  help [command]                                      display help for command
